commit 017109e3bd8ad45caa504201e51cc7e21723ed85
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 3 12:55:49 2026 +0900

    fix(phase-17): resolve L1 + L3 code review findings
    
    L1 FIX: normalizeDirection exact-match case coverage
    - Added test case: 'sHoRt' normalizes to 'long' (exact match only)
    - Updated LEARNING.md Option A snippet to show exact-match implementation
    - Clarified comment: mixed-case values map to long (mirrors frozen client)
    
    L3 FIX: Introduced NOT_IMPLEMENTED error code
    - Added ErrorCode.NOT_IMPLEMENTED enum value
    - Mapped to 501 HTTP status (semantic clarity: 501 = capability gap, not internal error)
    - Updated calculator stub to use NOT_IMPLEMENTED instead of INTERNAL_ERROR
    - Future /compute implementation can inherit this code without changes
    
    Verification: typecheck clean, 42 tests pass (includes new 'sHoRt' case)
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

